3M has a long-standing reputation as a company committed to innovation. We provide the freedom to explore and encourage curiosity and creativity. We gain new insight from diverse thinking, and take risks on new ideas. Here, you can apply your talent in bold ways that matter. Job Description:
Achieve sales objectives as set by management for cable accessory products in the assigned territory; Primarily, manage, sales territory with limited supervision and assistance;
Understand sales goals and establish self-directed sales coverage with manager’s assistance;
Apply business unit marketing policies, procedures and plans, and proactively report all new or unusual pertinent market conditions to supervisor as well as product performance information;
Promote business unit products and solutions to customers and prospects, and identify business opportunity and provide appropriate sales support to distributors;
Handel complaint independently;

2+ years of experience in digital marketing, with a strong sales track record;
Fluency in written and spoken English;
Existing relationships with clients and agencies in the industry;
Strong work ethic and drive to exceed expectations and targets;
An innovative, strategic mindset - you don't just sell, you build.

Bringing in new advertisers and building long-term partnerships with them;
Leading sales initiatives aligned with the company's overall strategy;
Negotiating contract terms and driving revenue growth;
Acting as a consultant to partners - sharing market insights and global best practices;
Acquiring new media partners and implementing products;
Representing the company at industry events, locally and abroad;
Keeping an up-to-date knowledge base of the online advertising landscape;

20 paid vacation days + paid sick leave;
50% coverage for sports, therapy, courses, and language classes;
Cross-team knowledge sharing - no unnecessary bureaucracy.
